      "body": "Hi, \n\nThanks for your questions! Sorry for my late responses. \n\nI realized that I didn't upload the preprocessing file for fig2 data, and please check [here] for details(https://github.com/siyuh/Squidiff_reproducibility/blob/main/preprocess_fig2_data.ipynb).  \n\nAnd please check the following detailed answers for your questions: \n1.&2 \u200bSpecific Number 203 and selection strategy:\u200b\u200b we are focused on iPSC development, so to simply the discovery and have efficient training, we just got top 200 variable genes, and we added a list of wnt signaling genes, which turned out only 3 genes are not there. \n\n3. No, it could handle more than thousand genes but the training definitely harder and slower. So I selected limited focused high variable gene lists for several studies. \n\nHope that answered your questions. \n\n",
